# Every env variant, because `.env` alone did not match `.env.production`,
# `.env.worker` or anything else someone adds later. PROBE_HASH_PEPPER cannot be
# rotated if it leaks (rotating it orphans every suppression row, which makes
# every person who opted out contactable again), so this pattern is deliberately
# broader than the files that exist today.
.env*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo/
coverage/

.vercel
